{
  "_comment": [
    "The demo Live Activity's ContentState for a demo request row (docs/demo-island.md).",
    "Written by hand, and held on BOTH sides: server/tests/test_demo_island.py runs",
    "demo_push.content_state over every case and mobile/__tests__/demoActivity.test.ts runs",
    "src/live/demoState.ts demoState, so the card the server pushes and the card the phone draws",
    "from its own poll are one card. The request is the route's own shape (`created_at` as",
    "`isoformat()` writes it, microseconds and all); `now` is Unix seconds; `expect: null` is a",
    "request no card shows. The phase is `demoStepFor`, the in-app island's rule, renamed."
  ],
